                                                "sense_id": "fc0e68dd-13d2-3050-8352-a7ed9571ad0b",
                                                "text": "他们没有经过思考就签订了合同。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa67cacf-7b82-43e1-bbfb-a1ffe055b210",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0e68dd-13d2-3050-8352-a7ed9571ad0b",
                                                "text": "本合同一式貳份，甲乙雙方各執一份。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f9ba0a4-1f22-4f9a-9989-912a5cd3731d",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0e68dd-13d2-3050-8352-a7ed9571ad0b",
                                                "text": "本合同一式贰份，甲乙双方各执一份。"
